  "loading.tip.06": "Tip: H to bandage, J for boost. Movement slows while healing.",
  "loading.tip.07": "Tip: Headshots are far more lethal depending on helmet level.",
  "loading.tip.08": "Tip: Press F to board a Kirpi APC and relocate quickly on the map.",
  "loading.tip.09": "Tip: Press M for the full map; your marker becomes the squad order target.",
  "loading.tip.10": "Tip: Going prone with Z makes you harder to spot at long range.",
